      en: ["Built: 18th century, exact year unknown.", "Stilt height: 2 m above ground.", "Pond area: 0.5 hectares.", "Restoration cost in 1981: 300,000 BND.", "Annual visitors: estimated 3,000.", "Sultan Muhammad Alam resided here 1822–1831."],
